# Day 18/60 — Build a Brain Dump Action Planner Skill

## Objective

Learn how to create a reusable Claude Skill that transforms unstructured notes into organized action plans.

## What I Built

A custom Claude Skill called:

Brain Dump Action Planner

The skill converts messy notes, meeting discussions, brainstorming sessions, and project ideas into structured outputs.

## Features

- Summary Generation
- Action Item Extraction
- Risk Identification
- Blocker Detection
- Open Questions Tracking
- Structured Planning

## What I Learned

### Skills > Repeated Prompts

Instead of rewriting the same prompt every time, a custom skill allows the workflow to be saved and reused.

### AI Handles Unstructured Information Well

Meeting notes, voice memo transcripts, and brainstorming documents can be transformed into actionable plans.

### Workflows Create Real Productivity Gains

The biggest value comes from creating repeatable systems that automate routine thinking tasks.

## Biggest Insight

Prompts solve a problem once.

Skills solve the same problem repeatedly.

